"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: \n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-10-02 00:00+0000\n"
"Last-Translator: Pocket Tuxemon project\n"
"Language-Team: Pocket Tuxemon\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"
